                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game seems interesting though I've played it just for some minutes. I'm giving it a \"Yes\" for now since it's free and I love puzzles.\n\nBut (and here comes the \"but\" part) ... man, it really made me sick when I had to move from one place to another using the side buttons. I felt a kind of dizziness I had not felt before. I think this is something in which you have to work on. I don't think I'm the only one with this \"motion sick\" problem in this game.\n\nThe rest, as I said before, seems nice and I think it worth a try. For now I'll close my eyes when I have to move myself.",
